Yahan
$cards
DECK 2 {SPADES, HEARTS}

$initial
DRAW 3 DEAL QEHI
QEHI 9 FACE_ALL
QEHI 2 FACE_ALL
QEHI 5 FACE_ALL
QEHI 2 FACE_ALL
QEHI 1 FACE_ALL
QEHI 9 FACE_ALL
QEHI 0 FACE_ALL
QEHI 8 FACE_ALL
QEHI 5 FACE_ALL
QEHI 8 FACE_ALL

$moves
MOVE QEHI QEHI
DEST Size >= 10
MOVE_STACK QEHI QEHI
OR
    DEST Empty
    DEST Rank K
DRAW
PILE ALL DRAW Empty
$win
OR
    AND
        PILE ALL QEHI Empty
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
    PILE ALL DRAW Empty
